# Reviewed Trivy exceptions (TE-014). One finding per line: the ID, then an expiry date.
# Format: <ID> exp:YYYY-MM-DD   (Trivy stops ignoring the entry after the date, so the scan fails again).
# Every entry needs a comment above it with the reason and an expiry date.

